sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant Server

    Server->>Client: createSurface(surfaceId: "main")
    Server->>Client: updateComponents(surfaceId: "main", components: [...])
    Server->>Client: updateDataModel(surfaceId: "main", path: "/user", value: "Alice")
    
    User->>Client: Interact with UI (e.g. click button)
    activate Client
    Client->>Server: action(name: "submit", context: {...})
    deactivate Client
    
    Client-->>Server: (UI is displayed)

    Note over Server,Client: Time passes, user interacts, or new data arrives...

    Server->>Client: 4. updateComponents or updateDataModel (Dynamic Update)
    activate Client
    Note over Client: Client re-renders the UI to reflect changes
    Client-->>Server: (UI is updated)
    deactivate Client

    Server->>Client: 5. deleteSurface(surfaceId: "main")
    activate Client
    Note over Client: Client removes the UI for the "main" surface
    Client-->>Server: (UI is gone)
    deactivate Client